Excluded registry operations:
asset.put: storage, editor, or derived-state maintenance
book.list: no current-book input boundary
book.purge: library-wide lifecycle operation
book.purge_expired: library-wide lifecycle operation
book.restore: book lifecycle belongs to the library
book.shelf: no current-book input boundary
book.trash: book lifecycle belongs to the library
comment.delete: cascade needs an F3 query exposing affected relations, including hidden endpoints
entry_snapshot.capture: entry snapshots need facade coverage and guarded whole-entry restore wiring
entry_snapshot.create: entry snapshots need facade coverage and guarded whole-entry restore wiring
entry_snapshot.create_with_receipt: entry snapshots need facade coverage and guarded whole-entry restore wiring
entry_snapshot.list: entry snapshots need facade coverage and guarded whole-entry restore wiring
entry_snapshot.preview: entry snapshots need facade coverage and guarded whole-entry restore wiring
entry_snapshot.restore: entry snapshots need facade coverage and guarded whole-entry restore wiring
history.restore_point: history restore labels require an atomic guarded owner hook
material.delete: cascade needs an F3 query exposing affected relations, including hidden endpoints
material.set_entry_link: material entry links need exact endpoint and relation read coverage
membership.restore: scoped membership undo is internal until K6 provides a guarded facade
module.edit_kv: field edits belong to a view that showed the field; use the record commands
module.edit_patch: field edits belong to a view that showed the field; use the record commands
module.prose_document: storage, editor, or derived-state maintenance
project.create: library-wide lifecycle operation
recent.touch: storage, editor, or derived-state maintenance
timeline_view.add_lane: local timeline edits need exact lane, placement, and pin read coverage
timeline_view.move_lane: local timeline edits need exact lane, placement, and pin read coverage
timeline_view.remove_lane: local timeline edits need exact lane, placement, and pin read coverage
timeline_view.rename: local timeline edits need exact lane, placement, and pin read coverage
timeline_view.restore_fields: scoped timeline undo is internal until K6 provides a guarded facade
timeline_view.set_lane_act_track: local timeline edits need exact lane, placement, and pin read coverage
todo.project: storage, editor, or derived-state maintenance
writing_day.record: storage, editor, or derived-state maintenance
